---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import HeroDemo from '../components/HeroDemo.astro';
import FeatureGrid from '../components/FeatureGrid.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { site } from '../config';
---
<Base><main id="main">
  <section class="hero container"><div class="hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow">YOUR BOT · YOUR WAY</div><span class="pill"><span class="pill-dot"></span> 内测中 · 欢迎体验与反馈</span><h1>让群聊，多一点<br/><em>猫猫的陪伴。</em></h1><p class="hero-description">AI 对话、关键词回复、插件与 MCP。<br/>把喜欢的玩法，放进你自己的 QQ 机器人里。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/beta/">加入候补名单 <Icon name="arrow" size={19}/></a><a class="button button-secondary" href="/features/">了解功能 <Icon name="arrow" size={19}/></a></div><div class="hero-meta"><span>QQ 群聊与私聊</span><span>自有 CF 后端</span><span>可视化配置</span></div></div><HeroDemo/></div><div class="platform-strip"><strong>为你的机器人，留出更多自由。</strong><div class="platform-items"><span><Icon name="chat"/>QQ 官方接口</span><span><Icon name="cloud"/>Cloudflare Pages</span><span><Icon name="sliders"/>独立 Web 控制台</span></div></div></section>
  <section class="section container"><div class="section-heading row"><div><div class="eyebrow">MAKE IT YOURS</div><h2>从一句回复，到更多可能。</h2><p>先把日常用得上的事情做好，再按自己的节奏扩展。</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/features/">看看猫猫能做什么 <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></div><FeatureGrid/></section>
  <section class="section steps-section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div class="eyebrow">GET STARTED</div><h2>三步，让猫猫来到你的群聊。</h2><p>后端放在你的 Cloudflare 账户，配置通过官方 WebUI 完成。</p></div><div class="steps-grid"><div><span class="step-number">01</span><h3>准备你的 QQ 应用</h3><p>创建支持 Webhook 的官方机器人，准备 AppID、AppSecret 和 CF 账户。</p><a class="text-link" href="/docs/qq-setup/">查看准备指南 <Icon name="arrow" size={16}/></a></div><div><span class="step-number">02</span><h3>安装后端，打开控制台</h3><p>获取首装包，上传到自己的 CF Pages。在 WebUI 准备 D1、QQ 和模型配置。</p><a class="text-link" href="/docs/getting-started/">跟着快速开始 <Icon name="arrow" size={16}/></a></div><div><span class="step-number">03</span><h3>连接 QQ，开始聊天</h3><p>保存配置，在 QQ 开放平台填入回调地址并验证，再发送第一条消息。</p><a class="text-link" href="/docs/getting-started/#验证-qq-回调与第一条消息">完成最后一步 <Icon name="arrow" size={16}/></a></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section container"><div class="section-heading row"><div><div class="eyebrow">BUILT TO EXTEND</div><h2>喜欢的玩法，自己来定义。</h2><p>从已有插件开始，或使用 SDK 写下你的新点子。</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/plugins/">插件与 SDK <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></div><div class="plugin-grid"><a class="plugin-card" href="/docs/developers/daily/"><div class="plugin-top"><span class="plugin-avatar"><Icon name="spark" size={26}/></span><span class="version">v1.0.3</span></div><h3>每日人品与图片</h3><p>查查今日人品，看看今日图。给群聊增加一点小小的日常仪式。</p><div class="command-tags"><code>/jrrp</code><code>/rejrrp</code><code>今日小马图</code></div><span class="card-link">了解 Daily <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></span></a><a class="plugin-card" href="/docs/developers/markdown-demo/"><div class="plugin-top"><span class="plugin-avatar"><Icon name="command" size={26}/></span><span class="version">v0.2.0</span></div><h3>Markdown 与按钮</h3><p>清楚地呈现内容，用指令按钮与互动回调演示更多交互。</p><div class="command-tags"><code>/md</code><code>/mdbuttons</code></div><span class="card-link">查看演示插件 <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></span></a><a class="plugin-card" href="/docs/developers/plugins/"><div class="plugin-top"><span class="plugin-avatar"><Icon name="code" size={26}/></span><span class="version">SDK {site.versions.sdk}</span></div><h3>写一个你的插件</h3><p>类型、构建器和测试工具已经准备好。从第一个问候命令开始。</p><div class="command-tags"><code>TypeScript</code><code>API v1</code><code>ZIP</code></div><span class="card-link">进入开发者文档 <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></span></a></div></section>
  <section class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div class="eyebrow">WHAT'S NEW</div><h2>猫猫，也在一点点长大。</h2></div><div class="update-card"><div class="update-version"><strong>0.8.6</strong><span>当前后端 / WebUI</span></div><div class="update-body"><h3>更灵活的关键词与命令面板</h3><p>群聊和私聊关键词回复、动态 Markdown 标签，以及可同步到 QQ 面板的斜杠命令。</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/changelog/">查看更新 <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></div></section>
  <section class="section container"><div class="cta-box"><div><h2>先来认识猫猫，再一起把它变得更好。</h2><p>项目正在内测。留下你想尝试的玩法，或先阅读文档了解它。</p></div><div class="cta-actions"><a class="button" href="/beta/">加入候补名单 <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a><a class="text-link" href="/docs/">阅读文档 <Icon name="book" size={16}/></a></div></div></section>
</main></Base>
